                            <h2 class="text-block__title">A Non-Surgical Solution for the Appearance of Hair Loss</h2>
                            <p class="text-block__desc mb-20">Hair thinning, bald patches and a receding hairline can affect your confidence. At <strong>Skin City India, Pune</strong>, Scalp Micropigmentation (SMP) is offered as a cosmetic treatment to create the appearance of fuller hair.</p>
                            <h2 class="text-block__title">What Is Scalp Micropigmentation?</h2>
                            <p class="text-block__desc mb-20">Scalp Micropigmentation is a cosmetic procedure that uses specialized pigments to create tiny, hair-like dots on the scalp.</p>
                            <p class="text-block__desc mb-20">These dots imitate the appearance of closely shaved hair follicles, helping reduce the visible contrast between the scalp and existing hair.</p>
                            <h2 class="text-block__title">Benefits of Scalp Micropigmentation</h2>
                            <ul class="text-block__desc pl-20 mb-30">
                                <li class="mb-10"><strong>Non-Surgical Procedure:</strong> No hair transplantation required.</li>
                                <li class="mb-10"><strong>Fuller Hair Appearance:</strong> Helps camouflage thinning areas.</li>
                                <li class="mb-10"><strong>Hairline Definition:</strong> Can improve the appearance of a receding hairline.</li>
                                <li class="mb-10"><strong>Scar Camouflage:</strong> May help conceal selected scalp scars.</li>
                                <li class="mb-10"><strong>Customized Results:</strong> Pigment placement is planned according to individual needs.</li>
                            </ul>
                            <h2 class="text-block__title">How Does the Treatment Work?</h2>
                            <p class="text-block__desc mb-20">Our specialists assess your scalp, hair loss pattern and desired appearance.</p>
                            <p class="text-block__desc mb-20">During the procedure, specialized pigments are carefully deposited into the scalp using a fine needle-based device. Multiple sessions may be needed to achieve the desired cosmetic effect.</p>
                            <p class="text-block__desc mb-20">Scalp Micropigmentation does not stimulate new hair growth.</p>
                            <h2 class="text-block__title">Consult a Scalp Micropigmentation Specialist</h2>
                            <p class="text-block__desc mb-20">Looking for a non-surgical way to improve the appearance of thinning hair or bald patches? Visit <strong>Skin City India</strong> for a personalized consultation.</p>
